## INTRODUCTION

https://overthewire.org/wargames/bandit/ strips everything back to the command line and forces you to actually think about what you're doing. No GUIs, no hand-holding, just you and a terminal.

The game works by chaining levels together - each level hides a password that unlocks the next. Along the way, you'll pick up essential Linux skills, get comfortable with SSH.

This walkthrough documents my process and progress as I work through each level.

If you're working through Bandit yourself, try solving each level independently before reading the solution.

